# Copy to `.env` (gitignored, never deployed) and fill in. Server-side only: nothing here
# reaches the browser. On AWS set these as Elastic Beanstalk environment properties instead.

# ElevenLabs text-to-speech, used by the voice scripts (`npm run dialogue:voices`, `scenes:voices`).
# Never set it on AWS: prod only serves baked clips and must not be able to pay.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Each character's voice id is a constant in server/dialogue/voices.mjs.
# 1 lets this server generate (and pay for) any line with no baked clip, for every open tab and QA
# run. Leave it off: the voice scripts generate regardless of this flag. Never set it on AWS.
# DIALOGUE_GENERATE=1
